  "description": "Swiss Arabian Rose 01 is a vibrant floral fragrance built around luxurious rose layered with juicy fruits and soft musk. The scent blends romantic florals with a bright fruity sparkle, creating an elegant and modern rose perfume. The opening introduces lychee, bergamot, and pink pepper, delivering a fruity-fresh brightness with a subtle spicy edge. The heart reveals Bulgarian rose and peony, forming a rich floral bouquet with soft romantic depth. The base settles into vanilla, musk, and cashmeran, leaving a smooth, slightly creamy trail with warm woody softness. Rose 01 is perfect for those who enjoy elegant rose fragrances with fruity freshness and a soft musky finish.",
